{"seq":2,"slug":"bounding-volumes","title":"第二章：包围体层次结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/bounding-volumes","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bvh-construction","title":"BVH 构建与遍历：游戏引擎碰撞检测的核心结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/bounding-volumes/bvh-construction","wordCount":1500,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"aabb-obb-spheres","title":"AABB、OBB 与包围球：游戏碰撞检测的几何基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/bounding-volumes/aabb-obb-spheres","wordCount":1608,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"dynamic-bvh-updates","title":"动态 BVH 更新策略：游戏物理的实时维护挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/bounding-volumes/dynamic-bvh-updates","wordCount":1573,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第二章-包围体层次结构\">第二章：包围体层次结构</h1><p>包围体层次（Bounding Volume Hierarchy，BVH）是现代游戏引擎中最重要的空间数据结构，Unreal Engine、Unity、PhysX、Jolt Physics 的碰撞检测宽相均以 BVH 为核心。本章从 BVH 的构建原理出发，系统讲解包围体类型的选择、层次遍历算法，以及动态场景下的高效维护策略。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容概览\">本章内容概览</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心解决的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"bvh-construction\">BVH 构建与遍历</a></td>\n<td>SAH 启发式、top-down/bottom-up</td>\n<td>如何构建高质量的层次树</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"aabb-obb-spheres\">AABB、OBB 与包围球</a></td>\n<td>几何测试、GJK/EPA 集成</td>\n<td>不同包围体的代价与精度权衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"dynamic-bvh-updates\">动态 BVH 更新策略</a></td>\n<td>refit、rebuild、fat AABB</td>\n<td>动态场景下避免全量重建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"bvh-的核心思想\">BVH 的核心思想</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Root[&quot;根节点\\n(场景总 AABB)&quot;] --&gt; L[&quot;左子树\\n(对象子集)&quot;]&#10;    Root --&gt; R[&quot;右子树\\n(对象子集)&quot;]&#10;    L --&gt; LL[&quot;叶节点\\n(单个对象)&quot;]&#10;    L --&gt; LR[&quot;叶节点\\n(单个对象)&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; RL[&quot;叶节点\\n(单个对象)&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; RR[&quot;叶节点\\n(单个对象)&quot;]\">graph TD\n    Root[\"根节点\\n(场景总 AABB)\"] --&gt; L[\"左子树\\n(对象子集)\"]\n    Root --&gt; R[\"右子树\\n(对象子集)\"]\n    L --&gt; LL[\"叶节点\\n(单个对象)\"]\n    L --&gt; LR[\"叶节点\\n(单个对象)\"]\n    R --&gt; RL[\"叶节点\\n(单个对象)\"]\n    R --&gt; RR[\"叶节点\\n(单个对象)\"]</pre><p>BVH 将场景对象递归地组织为二叉树，每个内部节点持有其所有子节点的包围体。查询时，若查询体与节点的包围体不相交，则剪枝整个子树，实现对数级加速。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"包围体精度-vs-测试代价\">包围体精度 vs 测试代价</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>包围体类型</th>\n<th>紧密度</th>\n<th>相交测试代价</th>\n<th>更新代价</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AABB</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>极低（6次比较）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>宽相、BVH 内部节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包围球</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低（1次距离比较）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>粗粒度剔除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OBB</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中（SAT 测试）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>窄相精确检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>k-DOP</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>特殊形状优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"静态-vs-动态-bvh\">静态 vs 动态 BVH</h2><p>本章的核心工程问题是：<strong>当场景中的对象持续移动时，如何维护 BVH 的质量？</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>完全重建</strong>：每帧从零构建，质量最优但代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>Refit</strong>：只更新包围盒大小，保持树结构不变，代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 但质量退化</li>\n<li><strong>增量更新</strong>：移除/插入叶节点，代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 每次更新</li>\n</ul>\n<p>实际引擎通常混合使用：静态对象预构建高质量 BVH，动态对象用 fat AABB + 增量更新。</p>\n"}